  with everyone we fell into it  day one miranda's so welcoming so sweet  i felt like a part of the cast  immediately  jerry loves to give me dating advice as  well like i'll he'll swipe through my  hinge for me or oh lord i'm probably  going to get off there but you know like  he would you know i go on bad dates we  talk about that nathan's super cool and  he's super frugal so when i would tell  him i was about to buy another chanel  bag he's like um ma'am  so you know it's just it's been it's  been a great dynamic and jayden feels  like my niece  so you know i it's been wonderful jaden  i'm curious to know have you gone back  and  binged icarly or did you come into it  totally fresh  i did start uh binging the show but i  didn't watch when i was younger  i actually started watching it a week  before i got the audition for the role  so you know going to the first table  read that was really magical  getting to meet all of the characters i  started fangirling over people are  weirdly loving this miranda what has  carly  been up to when we last saw her she was  on a plane heading off to italy like can  you kind of give me a summary of what  she's been up to  well she stayed in italy for a while  with her father she went to college  it's kind of funny because a lot of the  stuff that carly goes through are things  that i've gone through in real life i  went to college when the show ended  and then it's also kind of crazy because  in the pilot episode carly's starting  icarly for the first time in 10 years  and she's nervous and excited and that  was exactly how i felt in real life  life's too short to hold a grudge and  yet you won't forgive me for that  leggings incident  you didn't tell me you could see my  whole butt through them i thought that's  why you bought them  we can really see that miranda you and  lacy have such a fun  chemistry together and such a fun like  best friendship  how did you guys find that chemistry  together off screen to play it on screen  i have to really give that up to miranda  the second that i walked onto set  she sat next to me and she said hello  and it was just very cute she sat next  to me real close and she goes  hi and i love to tell people that cause  she's just such a warm and sweet person  so the chemistry  came easily we eat together all the time  we go get our nails done like  she really feels like a friend in real  life which she is so i think that that  comes across screen  um as well it's kind of funny because i  actually lacey and i met  on a super bowl commercial stand giant  dirt  hole for like four hours a few years ago  and i literally left there that day  thinking like she was so nice  and then we ended up doing this show  together so it's just funny you never  know what's gonna happen in life  oh sam miranda will we get to  learn a little bit about what sam is up  to in the new icarly reboot will we ever  figure out what her status is with  carly and with freddie yeah definitely  we talk a lot about the sam character  and where she is in the pilot episode  and the character carly  very much still loves sam and always  will  and we all really wanted jeannette to be  a part of the show in real life but  she's just  doing other things and we're really  happy for but yeah we're definitely  going to touch on that in the show  is the elevator door still open that if  jeannette wanted to come back as sam for  an episode could that happen  anytime if you could describe this new  icarly in one word how would you  describe it  a few words a few words thank you  because i need i need  two i'm gonna go with millennial and  camp because icarly is big it's fun it's  weird it's its own world and i think  that we  really stayed true to that miranda jerry  and nathan really wanted to make sure  that  that was intact but also it's  millennials like the girls we come out  of college we got  debt we don't have the job of our dreams  we're not dating anybody nobody's  married  so you're getting to see millennial and  you're going to see weird fun  i love it jaden how about you because i  did watch the original  and seeing how like crazy and kitty it  was i definitely think it's now  crazy and mature very very mature  you know as you said jerry can now cuss  on the show  and you know there have been a little  bit of bad words in the show  but thank goodness my parents are still  gonna let me watch it  i'm kind of stealing from the end of  what lacey said but  i think weird and fun if i if i can pick  two words  definitely weird and fun i feel like  icarly was always a little weird but it  was fun to embrace the weird so i'm  excited to see that back  for sure  you
 

